{% assign form_id = 'FactoryInquiry-' | append: section.id %}{% assign machine_names = 'CO2 Laser Cutting Machine,CNC Router,Laser Marking Machine,Fiber Laser Cutting Machine,Laser Welding Machine,UV Flatbed Printer' | split: ',' %}<div class="dd-factory"><section class="dd-factory__hero"><div class="dd-factory__wrap factory-hero"><div><p class="dd-factory__eyebrow">GUANGZHOU · CHINA · ESTABLISHED 2012</p><h1>Inside Our Laser &amp; CNC Equipment Factory</h1><p class="dd-factory__lead">Meet the people and see the workshop behind your equipment.</p><p>Guangzhou Dragon Diamond Technology Co., Ltd. brings together CO2 laser and CNC equipment manufacturing, sample testing and support for overseas customers.</p><div class="dd-factory__actions"><a class="dd-factory__button" href="#FactoryContact">Arrange a Factory Visit</a><a href="#FactoryProduction">Explore the Workshop →</a></div></div><figure class="factory-photo"><a href="{{ 'factory-workshop-overview.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Laser cutting machines and CNC equipment inside the Dragon Diamond workshop — open full photograph"><img src="{{ 'factory-workshop-overview.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1400x' }}" srcset="{{ 'factory-workshop-overview.jpg' | asset_img_url: '500x' }} 500w, {{ 'factory-workshop-overview.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }} 900w, {{ 'factory-workshop-overview.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1400x' }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 52vw, 100vw" width="4032" height="3024" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Laser cutting machines and CNC equipment inside the Dragon Diamond workshop"></a><figcaption>Laser cutting machines and CNC equipment inside the Dragon Diamond workshop</figcaption></figure></div></section><div class="dd-factory__wrap factory-facts"><div><strong>2012</strong><span>Company established</span></div><div><strong>2,000 m²</strong><span>Factory area</span></div><div><strong>Guangzhou</strong><span>Factory location, China</span></div><div><strong>Free sample test</strong><span>Discuss your material and artwork</span></div></div><nav class="dd-factory__wrap factory-jump" aria-label="Factory page sections"><a href="#FactoryProduction">Production</a><a href="#FactoryTeam">Our Team</a><a href="#FactoryCustomers">Customer Visits</a><a href="#FactoryExhibitions">Exhibitions</a><a href="#FactoryDelivery">Packing &amp; Loading</a><a href="#FactoryDocuments">Documents</a></nav><section class="dd-factory__section " id="FactoryProduction"><div class="dd-factory__wrap"><div class="factory-section-heading"><h2>From machine assembly to application review</h2><p>Explore our workshop records: frame preparation, hands-on equipment checks and material setup. Share your application so we can discuss the checks and sample work relevant to your order.</p></div><div class="factory-gallery "><figure class="factory-photo"><a href="{{ 'factory-frame-assembly.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="A technician working on a painted machine frame — open full photograph"><img src="{{ 'factory-frame-assembly.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }}" srcset="{{ 'factory-frame-assembly.jpg' | asset_img_url: '500x' }} 500w, {{ 'factory-frame-assembly.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }} 900w, {{ 'factory-frame-assembly.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1400x' }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw" width="4032" height="3024" loading="lazy"  alt="A technician working on a painted machine frame"></a><figcaption>A technician working on a painted machine frame</figcaption></figure><figure class="factory-photo"><a href="{{ 'factory-technical-inspection.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Technicians inspecting the machine bed and internal components — open full photograph"><img src="{{ 'factory-technical-inspection.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }}" srcset="{{ 'factory-technical-inspection.jpg' | asset_img_url: '500x' }} 500w, {{ 'factory-technical-inspection.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }} 900w, {{ 'factory-technical-inspection.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1400x' }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw" width="4032" height="3024" loading="lazy"  alt="Technicians inspecting the machine bed and internal components"></a><figcaption>Technicians inspecting the machine bed and internal components</figcaption></figure><figure class="factory-photo"><a href="{{ 'factory-sample-work-area.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Patterned material positioned on a laser cutting bed — open full photograph"><img src="{{ 'factory-sample-work-area.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }}" srcset="{{ 'factory-sample-work-area.jpg' | asset_img_url: '500x' }} 500w, {{ 'factory-sample-work-area.jpg' | asset_img_url: '900x' }} 900w, {{ 'factory-sample-work-area.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1400x' }} 1400w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 33vw, (min-width: 600px) 50vw, 100vw" width="1440" height="1080" loading="lazy"  alt="Patterned material positioned on a laser cutting bed"></a><figcaption>Patterned material positioned on a laser cutting bed</figcaption></figure></div><div class="factory-links"><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/co2-laser">Explore CO2 Laser Cutters →</a><a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/cnc-router">Explore CNC Routers →</a><a href="#FactoryContact">Request a Free Sample Test →</a></div></div></section><section class="dd-factory__section dd-factory__tint" id="FactoryTeam"><div class="dd-factory__wrap"><div class="factory-section-heading"><h2>The people behind your equipment</h2><p>Product knowledge and direct communication connect your requirements with equipment selection and technical support. Meet our team through training and team activity photographs.</p></div><div class="factory-gallery factory-gallery--two"><figure class="factory-photo"><a href="{{ 'factory-team-product-training.jpg' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Dragon Diamond team members in a product training session — open full photograph">